@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@callOffId = 1
@transportOrderId = 1
@invoiceId = 1

### Supplier order contacts and the logged-in user's copy-to default
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/recipients/SUPPLIERORDER/44774
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transporter contacts for a transport order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/recipients/TRANSPORTORDER/{{transportOrderId}}?receiverType=TRANSPORTER
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unsupported document type returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/recipients/unknown/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sent emails for a call-off
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/log/calloff/{{callOffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sent emails for a transport order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/log/transportorder/{{transportOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sent emails for an invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/log/invoice/{{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unsupported item type returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/log/unknown/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
